# The Jubilife tag battle, real. From CP4's end in the Oreburgh gym:
# heal at Oreburgh's Pokémon Center, Barry runs into the player at the city's west exit, back through the
# Oreburgh Gate and along Route 203 to Jubilife; Looker's scene on the way in; Team Galactic north of the TV
# station (coord event at 173–175, 743 while VAR_JUBILIFE_CITY_STATE is 3): Rowan, the counterpart (Dawn or
# Lucas by gender, the team by the player's starter) and the player against grunts 414 and 415 (decomp
# StartTagBattle → BATTLE_TYPE_TRAINER_WITH_AI_PARTNER, 75), then the Fashion Case. Wild battles on the way are
# fought (`wild auto`); trainer battles with `battle auto`, which answers the player's battler
